      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchada muloyim so'roq uchun '...mikin?', '...sa bo'ladimi?' ishlatamiz. Koreyschadagi -나요? / -(으)ㄴ가요? ham shunday yumshoq ohang beradi.",
      "compare_en": "English softens questions with 'Could you tell me…?' or 'I was wondering…'. Korean does it with the ending: -나요? / -(으)ㄴ가요? / 인가요?"
    }
